      "id": "ca466a13-8452-4797-8a37-0165f138c482",
      "title": "Welcome New Postmaster",
      "date": "2026-06-23",
      "detail": "Richard is our new town Postmaster, as we wish Matt the best of luck in your new position.  Richard is excited to help Wiley residents with their daily postoffice needs.  Richard had a suggestion for us to expedite mail delivery to us through the automated USPS system.  He suggested formatting our address as follows.  (100 Main St. #100) which is your physical address for UPS and FedEx and #100 for the Post office computer reading equipment.   Stop by and welcome Richard to Wiley!!",
